{
  "//": "Online co-op lobby. MULTIPLAYER goes to the pilot select like START; once a pilot is chosen this page opens instead of mission select, and mission select follows as soon as both players are connected. HOST GAME listens and shows on the line under the status what the other player needs (the join code over Steam, else this PC's address: the NET address when the router opened the port, else the LAN one); JOIN GAME connects to the address row (A on it to edit: left/right pick a number, up/down change it, A or B to finish). FIND GAME (shown when a relay transport such as Steam has a game list) lists open games of this build; picking one joins it, and a locked one asks for its password on that page. HOST SETTINGS sets the name the list shows and an optional password. When a host asks for a password, the address row becomes the password until the next JOIN GAME. Rows with label_src follow live text from the game (docs/guides/adding-menus-and-buttons.md).",
